{"time": 1757941303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1498209010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“因为警方并不重视这起案件，所以我就来拜托你们了。”"}
{"time": 1757941329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "572813788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“这是用来干嘛的？它有什么特别的价值值得被一名盗贼在众多藏品中选中偷窃”"}
{"time": 1757941413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "950552134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“事实而言。没人知道这是干嘛的，没人知道里面装了什么，也没人打开过这个小盒子。”"}
{"time": 1757941536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1050318229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“不过根据我的研究，这是柯南道尔记载的《最后一案》中的赃物，但不知道什么原因，出版的书籍中并没有提到这个事情。”"}
{"time": 1757941580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1937841687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”不是因为藏品的使用价值，而是因为其文化价值吗？“"}
{"time": 1757941584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1022865011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”说不定是柯南道尔的狂热信徒？“"}
{"time": 1757941690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2100597757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“为什么人们都不愿意打开这个盒子呢？”"}
{"time": 1757941713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "263066654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“一般来说不都会想知道里面是什么吗？”"}
{"time": 1757941825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1379944537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1022865011]“警方也是如此判定的。但不瞒你们说，我硕士的研究方向就是这个故事的真实性。而研究其中，我特意留意过关于星尘的传闻。传闻千奇百怪，但都往不好的方向的发展，指向了所谓的最终犯罪。联想到玛雅人的预言，我实在无法袖手旁观”"}
{"time": 1757941859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1878672556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2100597757]“不是不愿意，而是打不开。晃动起来里面有碰撞声，但并没有开口。”"}
{"time": 1757941939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1562765386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1379944537]\"你的意思是，这件藏品可能被用于一些可能存在的...邪恶仪式?\""}
{"time": 1757941942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2127265858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1379944537]“终极犯罪？这是怎么和玛雅人的末日预言扯上关系的？”"}
{"time": 1757942007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1492272370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1562765386]她摇摇头，“具体的用处我也不了解，也许有这种可能。”"}
{"time": 1757942109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2093375948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“诶，居然有人看小说看到这么走火入魔了吗。好歹模仿一下主人公嘛”"}
{"time": 1757942118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "161173124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2127265858]“在一份老旧手稿中，柯南道尔提及这是一件很危险的神秘武器，为了防止该物品被找到，他还特地隐藏了一段时间的行踪。”"}
{"time": 1757942191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "325162018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“有没有和盗贼相关的线索，比如说监控的记录之类的？”"}
{"time": 1757942194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1107217452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“也许是受到传闻的影响吧，直觉告诉我与此有关。”"}
{"time": 1757942228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "648498233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "“难道说请我们来到这里集合也是和那个传闻有关？”"}
{"time": 1757942302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1370803292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=325162018]“有，是那天监控录像的。”她拿出一张照片"}
{"time": 1757942353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "532440487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#接过照片查看"}
{"time": 1757942402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1885711027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=648498233]“可能是因为我的突然闯入慌张了吧，现场行窃犯漏了半张票据，上面写着前往阿卡姆的信息。我认为他应该有着一些计划的，所以在这里应该能查到相关的蛛丝马迹。”"}
{"time": 1757942429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1381506084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=532440487]照片内容似乎是房间天棚上监控录像录制的，照片上有一位身穿黑色皮衣，头戴面具的人。面具外面还有一只独眼的眼罩遮住了原本属于右眼的位置。根据这个人的体格可以判断他是一个中年的男性。他手中拿着某样东西，但是因为监控录像分辨率的问题，所以无法看清那个物体。那个盗窃者抬头盯着显示器，独眼的面具给人一种毛骨悚然的恐惧。"}
{"time": 1757942434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1656581630", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（灵感）"}
{"time": 1757942446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "810961191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=532440487]（奖励骰灵感）"}
{"time": 1757942452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2050554411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "。rab灵感"}
{"time": 1757942452, "type": "reply", "message_id": "2050554411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[亚当·史密斯]进行技能[灵感:75]检定: B={1D100=44 bonus:[9]}(44)=44 成功，春风得意马蹄急，一日看尽长安花"}
{"time": 1757942492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1852255621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "在你的脑海中，一个名字和这个面具重叠了起来：星期三"}
{"time": 1757942638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1743347083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#皱着眉头，把自己的联想告诉大家“最近有一位贵族被残忍杀害，凶手署名星期三...这个行为与监控录像中的凶手有些类似”"}
{"time": 1757942662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1698554084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“为什么呢”"}
{"time": 1757942667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1166931386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“柯南道尔笔下有哪位和他类似的角色嘛？”"}
{"time": 1757942703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1822516572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "她皱着眉头，思考了好一会，“没有”"}
{"time": 1757942742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2023368251", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#默默下巴“看到他对自己的角色有着独到的理解”"}
{"time": 1757942750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "413492264", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#默默下巴“看来他对自己的角色有着独到的理解”"}
{"time": 1757942760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2139768050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#摸摸下巴“看来他对自己的角色有着独到的理解”"}
{"time": 1757942876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948615478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“如此说来，我们下一步应该是去阿卡姆调查了...各位还有什么想问的问题吗？”"}
{"time": 1757942950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1566774729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“这个是个盗窃案，和杀人凶手有什么关系呢？”"}
{"time": 1757942967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "334237363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "“还有一件事我很好奇，我们来车站的时候注意到很多警察，请问是您报警的吗？”"}
{"time": 1757943003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1722193580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1566774729]“都喜欢留下自己的作案痕迹...当我灵光一现吧”"}
{"time": 1757943011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "595969615", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（其实我也不知道雾）"}
{"time": 1757943012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "351670423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1566774729]“也许是星尘能用来杀人？既然和星期三扯上关系，大家要以安全为上”"}
{"time": 1757943048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1369423011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“话说你们是怎么得到星尘的？”"}
{"time": 1757943054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "879059720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=334237363]“我早就报过警了，警察对此漠不关心。肯定不是我的原因。”"}
{"time": 1757943096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1124534273", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“星尘后来就一直收藏在221B的宅邸中，直到最近改造成博物馆才重见天日。”"}
{"time": 1757943106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "674528542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“星尘后来就一直收藏在221B的宅邸中，直到改造成博物馆才重见天日。”"}
{"time": 1757943167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2094043502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“21B宅府原本是属于谁？”"}
{"time": 1757943176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2135478714", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "就是柯南道尔的家"}
{"time": 1757943224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "279760517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“就是他的家，所有的故事，都从这里下笔。”"}
{"time": 1757943246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1971276467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（柯南道尔？）"}
{"time": 1757943250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "521234906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（嗯）"}
{"time": 1757943272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1055887976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（我没话说了，）"}
{"time": 1757943273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "622521044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "*打了个可乐嗝“我记得大家都很喜欢柯南道尔的小说啊，怎么会这样不关心呢”"}
{"time": 1757943279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1554627881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（探案集都是助手写的嘛）"}
{"time": 1757943341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1432425513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "“可是柯南道尔是怎么和玛雅文化里的世界末日扯上关系的？难道他老人家去过那？”"}
{"time": 1757943359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1592421011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=622521044]“算是很有乐子吧，但虚构出来的物品又有谁真正在意呢”"}
{"time": 1757943397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530109241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1432425513]“这只是我的一厢情愿而已......如果没有关系，那就最好了。”"}
{"time": 1757943502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "172029238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "“世界末日啊…是不是大家都完蛋了我就可以不用还贷款了？”"}
{"time": 1757943550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "500979088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "“说着玩的，如果我们有发现什么线索该怎么联系你呢？”"}
{"time": 1757943659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1261410518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（你没🈶联系方式嘛）"}
{"time": 1757943669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "310519974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“电话联系呗”"}
{"time": 1757943680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783356728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "她show出了自己的电话number"}
{"time": 1757943714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "127678820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“以及，这段时间我就打算住在密斯卡托尼克酒店了，有什么事情也可以直接来找我。当然，我也帮你们都订好了房间，到时候你们直接入住即可。””"}
{"time": 1757943781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "301345006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“好耶”"}
{"time": 1757943813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428179584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "“感谢您的慷慨，女士。”"}
{"time": 1757943841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1014729367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“不用谢，不知道各位还有没有什么疑问呢”"}
{"time": 1757943880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1297483838", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“没有了，我们先去找进一步的线索吧”"}
{"time": 1757943925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1472412272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“那就麻烦你们了，我也先就此告辞了”她和你们轻轻鞠了一躬，去前台结账后便离开了"}
{"time": 1757943974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1746136597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“偌大的城市，我们该从何找起呢？”"}
{"time": 1757944001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "845371879", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃有点在意富人被杀的凶案，想去酒馆寻找街边传言发现情况"}
{"time": 1757944017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1715859176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（你们已经是成熟的调查员了）"}
{"time": 1757944019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "779071636", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃把自己的想法告诉众人"}
