{"time": 1758111164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "296310224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“也许我们可以去校园走访调查一下这位死去的教授，他为何被凶杀…”"}
{"time": 1758111223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1409590363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "“凶杀案。。。剧院。。。英国巡演。。。”#如同脑门过电的阿斯顿有种不好的预感“我记得犯人是从英国逃窜的吧，不会这么赶巧吧”"}
{"time": 1758111226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "611005023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=592418184]”不对，如果按这份报纸的说法，应该是12月21日“"}
{"time": 1758111244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1198226977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“另外我想起了之前伦敦被杀害的那位富豪，我认为窃贼可能也在阿卡姆市的富人区会有所行动”"}
{"time": 1758111310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "711029277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "“我建议是等警局的同伴调查完后再决定接下来的行动”"}
{"time": 1758111358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "342124254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1409590363]”话虽如此，也不能完全肯定凶杀案和盗窃系同一人所为吧？这么多警察都摸不出来，我们通过这条线追凶的成功率应该不会很高“"}
{"time": 1758111368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1594816464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=711029277]”我同意“"}
{"time": 1758111417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "371859727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "“所以我们去吃左宗棠鸡吧，酸甜酸甜才是我心目中的中餐（）”"}
{"time": 1758111448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1653148031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#😓"}
{"time": 1758111463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "544398674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“其实我觉得他们在警察局调查的信息无非也是和凶杀案类似的情报……如果充分利用时间的话，我们可以先去走访看看，起码收集一些信息总不吃亏”"}
{"time": 1758111498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1009055054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“我们的走访的信息，也可以和他们在警察局中所调查的进行互补”"}
{"time": 1758111508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691117280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“不过先吃饭也没问题”"}
{"time": 1758111524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "740675407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃摊开双手"}
{"time": 1758111542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "451537714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "“大晚上的，学校估计关门了，警察局有人去了，剧场或许可以问问开场时间，总不能我们仨大晚上去墓地吧。”"}
{"time": 1758111590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "388003411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "#点上一根烟后散一根示意“哥们抽吗？”"}
{"time": 1758111602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1367213961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=451537714]”才出杀人事件，也不知道有没有解封，应该不会对一般人开放吧“"}
{"time": 1758111606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2041770036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“其实我确实有晚上去墓地看看的想法……说不定可以见到管理员小姐所说的怨魂”＃开着玩笑"}
{"time": 1758111666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "362035294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "“但毕竟墓地是公共区域不太可能封锁太久，只要我们不是去偷坟掘墓应该问题不大”"}
{"time": 1758111700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1627024845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "“那趁这个点突击一趟墓地？”"}
{"time": 1758111704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "445851124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1367213961]“据说犯罪者通常倾向于再次回到现场，蹲一波说不定有收获”＃古怪的笑容，同时接过阿斯顿的烟收起“谢了”"}
{"time": 1758111718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1679333397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“我觉得可以试试”"}
