{"time": 1758633356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1534306142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "亚当扶着安诺爬起来，几只秃鹫站在树梢，盯着你们，不知是嘲讽你们，还是物色可能的猎物。"}
{"time": 1758633403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "552581841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1864009955]“什么人？”警察注意到了远方的两个人影"}
{"time": 1758633418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1012172681", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃过去和巡警攀谈“警官你好，请问教堂的路上往山上走吗？”"}
{"time": 1758633425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1038220384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃过去和巡警攀谈“警官你好，请问教堂的路是往山上走吗？”"}
{"time": 1758633500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2112988300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“教堂...？”他看上山上，星空映出教堂黑色残垣的轮廓，“是这边没错，但已经荒废很久了，你们过去干什么”"}
{"time": 1758633595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590453242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“你好警官，我是刚来这边做研究史调查的精神科医生，想要来教堂做一个精神状况分析报告”*出示名片"}
{"time": 1758633624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1269203722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（荒废很久了你要找鬼魂做分析吗）"}
