{"time": 1758633815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1175690248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（彳亍）"}
{"time": 1758633818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2146369509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（我是不懂（））"}
{"time": 1758633818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1787555724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“啊？我第一次来到阿卡姆市，想找到这个教堂……原来已经荒废了嘛…我有一位至交死前嘱托我来东教堂附近的墓地帮他处理一下亲人的坟墓…但是我在途中迷了路，是这位小姐带我来此”"}
{"time": 1758633838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1569397171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“原本还想着可不可以在教堂留宿一宿”"}
{"time": 1758633852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1488039424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "*自信抬头挺胸"}
{"time": 1758633855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "413415511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=310570076][CQ:at,qq=408119794] （玩手机我是）"}
{"time": 1758633861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123407421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "（你们先跑完）"}
{"time": 1758633876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "26491429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃递给警察一根烟“教堂是什么时候荒废的？”"}
{"time": 1758633908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "439584446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“是这样呀”警察应这亚当的话，随机拿着安诺的反复确认，“是我认识匪浅了，小姐要怎么从残垣去考察呢？”"}
{"time": 1758633928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522011779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（乐，快给理科生讲解一下流程）"}
{"time": 1758633979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "388364526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“可多了啊，比如说建筑风格、成型年代等等。说到底对断壁调查只是一小部分，更多的还是去对人问”"}
{"time": 1758634118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1099894854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“很久了呀，一百多年了应该。小哥怎么大晚上的过去那边，不害怕么。”他叼起烟，拿出了打火机"}
{"time": 1758634204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "450521473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=388364526]“这样“他侧身指了下旁边的山路，”一直走就行，不过大晚上的我是不建议你们上去的。”"}
{"time": 1758634229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "311902774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“你们也知道墓地出事了吧”"}
{"time": 1758634245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1269433767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“诶？”"}
{"time": 1758634255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "33705306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“这我好像有所耳闻？那个墓地原来是在这么？”"}
{"time": 1758634300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1477743076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“好像是发生了凶杀案？”"}
{"time": 1758634315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1446452346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“阿卡姆还有哪个墓地吗。”他无奈得摆摆手，“嗯，昨晚这里可是连环杀人犯的杀人现场呀”"}
{"time": 1758634359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1998393999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“都说了让大家注意安全，你们两位还敢来这里，不知道说你们胆子大呢，还是？”"}
{"time": 1758634375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "496656879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“啊，那这位小姐，我还是建议你不要去那个教堂了…等到明天早上再去吧，毕竟太危险”"}
{"time": 1758634423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "8990623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃露出有些不安的神色“我真是太倒霉了，警察同志你看我这下山会不会也有危险啊……要不我就在呆一晚吧，有警察在我应该是安全的”"}
{"time": 1758634493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1080451807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“果咩果咩，，，”"}
