{"time": 1758635119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "871632484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“也行吧，虽然我觉得没啥必要就是了。”说完，警察带你们来到墓地门口旁边的临时棚屋，里面还有几张小椅子"}
{"time": 1758635180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181576940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃我先看会自己带在身边的闲书，等天色晚些"}
{"time": 1758635182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "127422780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“你们可别乱跑，我担心杀人犯还会过来。”他拿起旁边的电热水壶，为你们两个装了杯水"}
{"time": 1758635188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2127534299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（还是说安诺不跟过去？）"}
{"time": 1758635194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1662220212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“好哦，谢谢你”"}
{"time": 1758635282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "191968713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“谢谢了，您也挺劳累，大冬天的还在这里一个人看着，没有其他警官一起嘛？”"}
{"time": 1758635308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "709446266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1864009955]（）"}
{"time": 1758635322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1436707752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（当我不知道，）"}
{"time": 1758635337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1814921473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“有，在里面巡逻呢”他指了下旁边的杯子，里面的红茶已经失去了些许温度"}
{"time": 1758635410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "315779245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“话说这里到底发生了什么，警察你有兴趣具体讲讲吗？不瞒你说，我那位至交是位侦探高手，我还是和他学了几把刷子的，说不定能来帮上忙”"}
{"time": 1758635675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "454046448", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“墓地的凶杀案么，和普通的比起来凶狠了很多，我们认为就是星期三做的。”"}
{"time": 1758635708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1837173025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“墓地的凶杀案么，和普通的比起来凶狠了很多，更像是虐杀案。其实凶手吧应该很明显，就是星期三做的，那里有血字”"}
{"time": 1758635731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "870294302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“星期三，是我知道的那个伦敦富豪凶案的凶手星期三吗？”"}
{"time": 1758635788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "791502843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“伦敦也有凶杀案么？那可能也是他所为。他还去过伦敦啊....会不会是模仿犯？”"}
{"time": 1758635800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "223120836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "*安静喝茶"}
{"time": 1758635808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "10845224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“毕竟星期三作为恐怖分子在网上很出名”"}
{"time": 1758635864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1890520481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“我还关注过那个案子来着，也是凶手残忍行凶后故意留下【星期三】这个名字”"}
{"time": 1758635889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "654066358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=10845224]“这是什么意思，难道他们还有一个组织？”"}
{"time": 1758635949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1844124784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“还是不约而同的犯罪模仿…亦或是只有一个人？”"}
{"time": 1758635970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "141381794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“不无可能，恐怖分子很有成群的可能性，一个也可能，一个组织也可能”"}
{"time": 1758635985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "314393333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“但他威胁了我们的安全，这肯定不会错的”"}
{"time": 1758635990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "214706997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“那还真是，精神不正常”"}
{"time": 1758636001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1001705795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“不论哪个可能”"}
{"time": 1758636018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396163580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃拿出手机搜索【星期三】这个名字，查找发生的一系列有关案件，注意时间顺序"}
