{"time": 1758636720, "type": "reply", "message_id": "453542744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[亚当·史密斯]进行理智检定[60]:\n1D100=57 成功，春风得意马蹄急，一日看尽长安花\n理智减少1=1点,当前剩余[59]点"}
{"time": 1758636762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2114525806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃被吓一跳，从座位上蹦起来，差点没拿稳手机"}
{"time": 1758636790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "942855766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“多磨多磨？”"}
{"time": 1758636806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1023307819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "这之后的晃眼间，手机已经恢复了原样，浏览器展示着星期三的搜索页面。"}
{"time": 1758636848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1370673933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“怎么了么”警察看着你惊慌的反应，“放心，这里现在还算安全，有我们在。”"}
{"time": 1758636851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "163755983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“我在搜星期三时好像看到了什么血腥的东西……可能是我有些神经敏感”"}
{"time": 1758636938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "278508564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃被这么一吓，失去了使用手机的兴趣，转而再次找到警官随便聊聊摆脱不适的情绪"}
{"time": 1758636943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "968639506", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“这样....那换个话题吧。您是侦探是吧”"}
{"time": 1758636960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "755765239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“这样....那换个话题吧。您是侦探的朋友是吧”"}
{"time": 1758636979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "878318058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“还真是…其实我已经在尝试兼职私家侦探了”"}
{"time": 1758637007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "378545138", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“有什么我可以帮上忙的嘛？”"}
{"time": 1758637057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52217976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“你有没有见过这个东西？”警察用手在桌子上比划着，“一个五芒星，中间画着一个漫画般的眼睛，emmmm，或者说像是一个类似于眼睛的菱形火焰形状。”"}
