{"time": 1758637431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "235533774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“现场就画着这个东西，用被害者的血液画的。”"}
