{"time": 1758694250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1495641420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（毕竟你走了一大圈了）"}
{"time": 1758694331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "630320799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=887710622]你走到终端处查阅‘星尘’二字，都是一些童话故事和星空科普"}
{"time": 1758694403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1237794524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“没有吗？看来比起市立图书馆，这里的藏书还是略有空缺呢”"}
{"time": 1758694418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "697274675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#那查阅当地神话"}
{"time": 1758694430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1392031252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（市立也没有捏）"}
