{"time": 1758694586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "343769308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "你翻阅着神话书籍，作为殖民大国，美国的神话十分多元，大多你都有所了解"}
{"time": 1758694591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1080475802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=2447503622] 来吧）"}
{"time": 1758694623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "121107780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "正当菲莉汐娅还在翻找着书籍的同时，阿斯顿与学生交谈过，也来到了图书馆"}
{"time": 1758694653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1100340449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "“真阔，我学校可没这么好的图书馆。”#吐槽一句后在地图上搜索地下室的位置"}
{"time": 1758694760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1917613393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "地图就在图书馆管理员前台附近。地下室的位置很偏僻，沿着走廊直走，在一个旮旯转角后便是。"}
{"time": 1758694803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2142996672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "（管理员是位老婆婆吗？）"}
{"time": 1758694818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1760583723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "是个学生"}
{"time": 1758694843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1600628402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "#那直接往地下室走"}
{"time": 1758694859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "947563971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（直接下去是吗）"}
